 you want to do tomorrow morning?":[194,195],"#Day Review#Morning before Office#What did you have for breakfast?":[196,198],"#Day Review#In office":[199,213],"#Day Review#In office#How long were you lost today?":[201,202],"#Day Review#In office#What were the major accomplishments of the day?":[203,204],"#Day Review#In office#What could I have done better?":[205,206],"#Day Review#In office#What caused me the most stress today?":[207,208],"#Day Review#In office#What did you eat for lunch?":[209,210],"#Day Review#In office#What is something you should have done but won't do today? When do you plan to do it?":[211,213],"#Day Review#At home after work":[214,229],"#Day Review#At home after work#What are my long-term goals and did I make any progress towards them?":[216,217],"#Day Review#At home after work#What made Homa angry/moody today?":[218,219],"#Day Review#At home after work#Did you talk to Mom and Dad?":[220,221],"#Day Review#At home after work#What did you have for dinner?":[222,223],"#Day Review#At home after work#Any cheat items that you ate today? Did you eat them out of boredom or stress?":[224,225],"#Day Review#At home after work#Did you practice mindfulness in the evening?":[226,227],"#Day Review#At home after work#Looking back at the day, these are the thoughts that I struggled the most with. How do I intend to resolve these feelings?":[228,229],"#Day Review#Plan For tomorrow":[230,250],"#Day Review#Plan For tomorrow#Review of today as per yesterdays expectations.":[232,233],"#Day Review#Plan For tomorrow#What are my goals for tomorrow?":[234,250],"#Day Review#Plan For tomorrow#What are my goals for tomorrow?#{1}":[236,236],"#Day Review#Plan For tomorrow#What are my goals for tomorrow?#{2}":[237,237],"#Day Review#Plan For tomorrow#What are my goals for tomorrow?#{3}":[238,238],"#Day Review#Plan For tomorrow#What are my goals for tomorrow?#{4}":[239,239],"#Day Review#Plan For tomorrow#What are my goals for tomorrow?#{5}":[240,240],"#Day Review#Plan For tomor